    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 36,
      "text": "World Biodiversity Forum 2026, Davos"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 74,
      "text": "The Role of AI in (IPBES) Assessments\nand Biodiversity Literature Analysis"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 18,
      "text": "Hype or Salvation?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 28,
      "text": "Rainer M Krug & Patrick Ruch"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 37,
      "text": "SIB Swiss Institute of Bioinformatics"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 1,
      "text": "￼"
    },
    {
      "kind": "NOTE",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 34,
      "text": "First: what do we mean by AI here?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 138,
      "text": "The IPBES Code of Practice focuses on AI that experts use directly in assessments, not the underlying statistics or custom-trained models."
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 8,
      "text": "Relevant"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 141,
      "text": "Generative AI (LLMs, ChatGPT, Claude…)\nImage generators\nLiterature search & synthesis tools\nTranslation & editorial assistance\nCoding support"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 29,
      "text": "Less Relevant in this Context"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 83,
      "text": "Machine learning & statistical modelling\nDeveloping or training own AI systems\nEtc."
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 1,
      "text": "￼"
    },
    {
      "kind": "NOTE",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 28,
      "text": "One question to keep in mind"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 94,
      "text": "Is AI in biodiversity research\na collaborator, a tool(maker),\nor a rogue / destructive player?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 59,
      "text": "Not rhetorical — where do you land by the end of this talk?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 1,
      "text": "￼"
    },
    {
      "kind": "NOTE",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 11,
      "text": "THE PROMISE"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 1,
      "text": "“"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 257,
      "text": "By 2035, I envision ecological research in which AI systems help synthesize literature, test hypotheses, optimize experimental designs, and develop scientific software — while scientists provide vital context, creativity, verification, and ethical judgment."
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 127,
      "text": "Sara Beery (MIT) · AI & Ecology: From Tool to Transformation · Dædalus, Winter/Spring 2026, American Academy of Arts & Sciences"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 1,
      "text": "￼"
    },
    {
      "kind": "NOTE",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 22,
      "text": "THE LITERATURE PROBLEM"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 17,
      "text": "Tens of thousands"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 73,
      "text": "of publications from 2025 may include invalid references generated by AI."
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 89,
      "text": "Naddaf & Quill · Nature, 652, pp. 26–29 (April 2026) · doi.org/10.1038/d41586-026-00969-z"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 1,
      "text": "￼"
    },
    {
      "kind": "NOTE",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 19,
      "text": "THE EQUITY QUESTION"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 1,
      "text": "“"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 284,
      "text": "Access to large, standardized data infrastructure, AI tools, computational resources, and capacity building remains unevenly distributed, concentrating research capacity in technologically advanced regions while marginalizing insights from biodiversity hotspots in developing nations."
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 127,
      "text": "Sara Beery (MIT) · AI & Ecology: From Tool to Transformation · Dædalus, Winter/Spring 2026, American Academy of Arts & Sciences"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 1,
      "text": "￼"
    },
    {
      "kind": "NOTE",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 16,
      "text": "The core tension"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 11,
      "text": "Urgent need"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 124,
      "text": "Too much literature for any team to read\nBiodiversity knowledge gaps are critical\nAI can process data at unprecedented scale"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 12,
      "text": "Serious risk"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 134,
      "text": "Hallucinated references polluting the literature\nSimulated authority mistaken for expertise\nKnowledge concentrated in the Global North"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 1,
      "text": "￼"
    },
    {
      "kind": "NOTE",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 38,
      "text": "The IPBES response: a Code of Practice"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 49,
      "text": "Version 1.0 · Welcomed at IPBES 12, February 2026"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 31,
      "text": "Responsibility & accountability"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 25,
      "text": "Transparency & disclosure"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 27,
      "text": "Bias awareness & mitigation"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 38,
      "text": "Scientific integrity & reproducibility"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 39,
      "text": "Data governance & intellectual property"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 29,
      "text": "Alignment with UN core values"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 15,
      "text": "Confidentiality"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 84,
      "text": "Covers: editorial · translation · coding\nliterature search · data analysis · figures"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 31,
      "text": "doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.17628864"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 1,
      "text": "￼"
    },
    {
      "kind": "NOTE",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 37,
      "text": "Where AI can concretely help in IPBES"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 67,
      "text": "Returning to the core tension: here is where the laundry gets done."
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 20,
      "text": "Literature screening"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 51,
      "text": "Triage thousands of papers; AI flags, humans decide"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 22,
      "text": "Dynamic visualisations"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 54,
      "text": "Data-driven and conceptual figures at assessment scale"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 18,
      "text": "Draft verification"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 49,
      "text": "Cross-checking consistency, interlinks, citations"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 20,
      "text": "New delivery formats"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 52,
      "text": "Chatbots (e.g. ClimateQA), linked living assessments"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 24,
      "text": "UN language requirements"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 46,
      "text": "Translation & formatting across 6 UN languages"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 24,
      "text": "Internal document search"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 39,
      "text": "Linking across IPBES assessment archive"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 132,
      "text": "Which brings us back to the question we started with: what do we actually want AI to do — and what do we want to keep for ourselves?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 69,
      "text": "The IPBES Code of Practice on AI is a starting point — not an answer."
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 1,
      "text": "￼"
    },
    {
      "kind": "NOTE",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 233,
      "text": "“You know what the biggest problem with pushing all-things-AI is? Wrong direction.\n \nI want AI to do my laundry and dishes so that I can do art and writing, not for AI to do my art and writing so that I can do my laundry and dishes.”"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 52,
      "text": "Joanna Maciejewska (@AuthorJMac) · X · 29 March 2024"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 1,
      "text": "￼"
    },
    {
      "kind": "NOTE",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 85,
      "text": "If an AI had written a literature review,\nwould (should) you know?\n \nShould you care?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
